    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "For sale by private treaty on behalf of Coillte Teoranta, this 1.3 acre plot lies approximately 5km north east of the town of Newtowncunningham, approximately 20km from Letterkenny and an approximate 15 minute drive to Derry City in Northern Ireland. The plot fronts onto L-7971-2 and is approx. 2km to the N-13. The plot forms an L shape and is in an elevated position with views over Lough Swilly and would have potential for the construction of a dwellinghouse (subject to planning approval). All enquiries welcome."
